{"ticker":{"symbol":"348340.KQ","name":"뉴로메카","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":14820.0,"change_pct":0.024896265560165887,"market_cap":346912849920.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":13210.0,"week52_high":82986.125,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":123,"website":"https://www.neuromeka.com","business_summary":"Neuromeka Co., Ltd. manufactures industrial robots. It builds a Robot as a Service platform business ecosystem centered on collaborative robots. The company offers collaborative, industrial, mobile, embedded, and delta robots; smart actuators, robot controllers, accessories, teach pendants, and vision solutions, as well as robot software; standard tools; and robot platform and remote maintenance management services. It serves the manufacturing, F&B service, and media and art applications. Neuromeka Co., Ltd. was founded in 2013 and is based in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)뉴로메카는 산업용 로봇을 제조하는 회사입니다. 협동로봇을 중심으로 서비스형 로봇(Robot as a Service) 플랫폼 비즈니스 생태계를 구축합니다. 이 회사는 협업, 산업용, 모바일, 임베디드 및 델타 로봇을 제공합니다. 스마트 액추에이터, 로봇 컨트롤러, 액세서리, 티치 펜던트, 비전 솔루션, 로봇 소프트웨어; 표준 도구; 로봇 플랫폼 및 원격 유지보수 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 제조, F&B 서비스, 미디어 및 예술 애플리케이션을 제공합니다. 뉴로메카(주)는 2013년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"산업기계","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":9754641460.0,"operating_income":-7792941740.0,"net_income":-8200588550.0,"eps":-568.962409},{"period":"2023","revenue":13742971100.0,"operating_income":-14825326560.0,"net_income":-17653500200.0,"eps":-1011.356055},{"period":"2024","revenue":25269404820.0,"operating_income":-19015006170.0,"net_income":-16754713000.0,"eps":-948.668696},{"period":"2025","revenue":18954203200.0,"operating_income":-14856578040.0,"net_